      "definitions": {"zh-CN": "数据类型规定一个值属于哪一类（整数、浮点、字符串、布尔等），决定它能参与哪些运算以及如何显示。", "en": "A data type classifies a value (integer, float, string, boolean, ...) and determines which operations are valid and how it is displayed."},
