      "definitions": {"zh-CN": "类型转换把值从一种类型变成另一种，例如 int(\"42\") 把字符串变成整数；转换可能失败，需要处理异常。", "en": "Type conversion turns a value of one type into another, e.g. int(\"42\") converts text to an integer; conversion can fail and should be handled."},
